(12, 12, 'You are an expert Rwandan educator. Generate a COMPREHENSIVE lesson plan for the REB curriculum.\n\n**MANDATORY OUTPUT FORMAT:**\nYou must return only a valid JSON object. No other text.\n\n**JSON SCHEMA:**\n{\n  \"header_details\": {\n    \"special_needs_provision\": \"Detailed provision for the specific special needs mentioned\",\n    \"unit_title\": \"...\",\n    \"key_unit_competence\": \"...\",\n    \"lesson_title\": \"...\",\n    \"instructional_objective\": \"SMART objective: By using [materials], every learner will be able to [action] [concept] correctly.\",\n    \"plan_for_class\": \"Location details\",\n    \"learning_materials\": \"Specific list of tools/materials\",\n    \"references\": \"Official REB books and other sources\"\n  },\n  \"lesson_flow_overview\": \"A 3-4 sentence overview of what happens in the lesson.\",\n  \"phases\": [\n    {\n      \"phase_name\": \"Introduction / Engage\",\n      \"timing\": \"5-10 min\",\n      \"teacher_activities\": [\"Step 1...\", \"Step 2...\"],\n      \"learner_activities\": [\"Learner response 1...\", \"Learner response 2...\"],\n      \"competences_and_cross_cutting\": [\"Competence: Description...\", \"Cross-cutting: Explanation...\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"phase_name\": \"Development / Explore & Explain\",\n      \"timing\": \"25-50 min\",\n      \"teacher_activities\": [\"Modeling...\", \"Guided practice...\", \"Asking: [Question]\"],\n      \"learner_activities\": [\"Hands on activity...\", \"Responding: [Answer]\"],\n      \"competences_and_cross_cutting\": [\"...\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"phase_name\": \"Final / Elaborate\",\n      \"timing\": \"10-20 min\",\n      \"teacher_activities\": [\"Application task...\"],\n      \"learner_activities\": [\"Executing task...\"],\n      \"competences_and_cross_cutting\": [\"...\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"phase_name\": \"Conclusion / Evaluate\",\n      \"timing\": \"10-15 min\",\n      \"teacher_activities\": [\n        \"Summarizing...\",\n        \"MCQ Question 1 (Voting Cards): [Question]? a) b) c) d). Expected Answer: [X]\",\n        \"MCQ Question 2...\",\n        \"Assigning Homework: 1. Task A, 2. Task B\"\n      ],\n      \"learner_activities\": [\"Participating in summary...\", \"Answering MCQs...\", \"Recording homework...\"],\n      \"competences_and_cross_cutting\": [\"...\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n**INPUT DATA:**\n- School: GS BUSANZA / Teacher: Demo Teacher / Subject: Mathematics / Class: undefined\n- Unit: 1 - Introduction To Quadratic Equation\n- Lesson: 2 - Summation and subtraction of roots\n- Duration: 80 minutes\n- Term: Term 1 / Date: Thu Jan 29 2026 00:00:00 GMT+0200 (Central Africa Time) / Size: 32\n- Special Needs: 1 with Visual, 2 with Physical\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. **NO PLACEHOLDERS.** Generate real, detailed content.\n2. **PHASES:** You must strictly follow the 5Es (Engage, Explore, Explain, Elaborate, Evaluate) but formatted into these 4 logical table rows.\n3. **DEPTH:** For 80 mins, provide a lot of detail (5-10 pages worth of logic).\n\nGenerate the JSON now:', '[1]', 'groq', 4.708, NULL, '2026-01-28 15:49:24'),
